meta {
  name: Get Trip Timeline - All Events
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/trips/1/timeline
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  Get unified timeline for a trip with all events sorted chronologically.

  Returns a merged, sorted timeline containing:
  - Accommodations (check-ins, check-outs, stays)
  - Transits (flights, trains, etc.)
  - Activities (sightseeing, dining, etc.)
  - Bookings (tours, reservations, etc.)

  All items are sorted by date and time for easy client-side rendering.

  Replace '1' in URL with actual trip ID.

  **Response includes:**
  - `trip_id`: Trip ID
  - `timeline`: Array of timeline items
  - `total_items`: Total count of events

  **Each timeline item includes:**
  - `type`: Event type (accommodation, transit, activity, booking)
  - `date`: Event date
  - `time`: Event time (if available)
  - `name`: Event name
  - `data`: Full event object with all details
}
